cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "DocKG: Semantic Knowledge Graph for Document Corpora"
abstract: >
  DocKG builds a semantically searchable knowledge graph from markdown and text
  documents. It indexes document chunks, sections, topics, and entities as nodes
  with structural edges, enabling hybrid semantic + graph queries, cross-document
  relationship discovery, and MCP-based AI integration for document understanding.
